      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently praise the veterinarians for their direct, thorough, and compassionate care during animal checkups and minor emergencies. Conversely, several reviewers report negative interactions with front-desk staff, describing unhelpful attitudes and aggressive upselling of supplementary clinic products."
      }
