      "title": {
        "en": "Significant wait times for walk-in visits"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "A primary theme across reviews is the long wait time at this first-come, first-served facility, with multiple owners waiting two to over three hours for routine vaccinations. While some clients consider the delay acceptable given the affordability, many express frustration when wait estimates turn out inaccurate."
      }
    },
    {
